4
00:00:10,199 --> 00:00:13,242
a shortlist by Friday. Every profile has to be

5
00:00:13,242 --> 00:00:16,485
filtered, downloaded, called, judged and pitched,

6
00:00:16,485 --> 00:00:19,065
and every one of those steps is done by

7
00:00:19,065 --> 00:00:19,396
hand.

8
00:00:20,146 --> 00:00:22,587
What if an agent filtered the portal,

9
00:00:22,587 --> 00:00:26,217
downloaded the profiles, prepared every screening call,

10
00:00:26,217 --> 00:00:29,450
scored English proficiency, experience, location,

11
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:32,485
salary ask and working hours against the role,

12
00:00:32,485 --> 00:00:35,652
and drafted the pitch, while a person made every

13
00:00:35,652 --> 00:00:39,216
decision that matters? That is hiring flow automation,

14
00:00:39,216 --> 00:00:41,195
done with Claude, done safely.

15
00:00:41,945 --> 00:00:46,675
Gennoor Tech presents HR Hiring Flow Automation with Claude.

16
00:00:47,425 --> 00:00:50,054
One job requisition in. One approved,

17
