22
00:01:05,971 --> 00:01:09,666
A recruiter approves every outreach and every pitch.

23
00:01:09,666 --> 00:01:11,442
And everything is logged.

24
00:01:12,192 --> 00:01:14,849
You begin by mapping the real hiring flow,

25
00:01:14,849 --> 00:01:17,443
from the job portal of your choice to the

26
00:01:17,443 --> 00:01:20,860
