27
00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:23,897
may propose and which only a person may approve.

28
00:01:23,897 --> 00:01:26,554
Then you set up Claude Code with a project

29
00:01:26,554 --> 00:01:28,578
file that encodes hiring policy,

30
00:01:28,578 --> 00:01:30,666
