Unknowns are marked, never guessed.

42
00:02:07,887 --> 00:02:10,259
On day two you reach the candidate.

43
00:02:10,259 --> 00:02:13,309
Claude drafts a call script from the role and

44
00:02:13,309 --> 00:02:17,036
